ents and other inputs that will still need to be passed through our process, to our formulas and contracts, what creates a temporary compression of our margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/pilgrims-pride-corp-ppc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"PPC 2019 Q1","e":"ppc","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jayson Penn","x":"These increases resulted in excess of $18 million in the quarter, of which $13 million were partially offset by cost reduction initiatives synergies and price adjustments of some which have taken longer and expected to be passed on and reflected in the contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/pilgrims-pride-corp-ppc-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"PPC 2019 Q2","e":"ppc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jayson Penn","x":"As the roughly year-long 20% tariff has dropped in May, we've actually seen same, at the same time, an increase of import price by approximately 70% of the bone in hands which is actually the big item, so a net price increase of 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/pilgrims-pride-corp-ppc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"PPC 2019 Q2","e":"ppc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jayson Penn","x":"It's still early to see the full long-term effect of the tariff removal, but of course, anytime that market becomes more efficient, we're in favor of that, Ben.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/pilgrims-pride-corp-ppc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"PPC 2019 Q2","e":"ppc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jayson Penn","x":"That's just recent -- very recent numbers so, really have a net price increase of 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/pilgrims-pride-corp-ppc-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"PPC 2019 Q2","e":"ppc","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power"